** GC & Handlers During Boot
Straight, Org parsing, and hundreds of module evals allocate heavily.
Raise the GC threshold during init, drop expensive file-name handlers,
restore both when init settles.
#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(setq gc-cons-threshold (* 64 1024 1024)
      gc-cons-percentage 0.6)
(defvar my/saved-file-name-handler-alist file-name-handler-alist)
(setq file-name-handler-alist nil)
(add-hook 'after-init-hook
          (lambda ()
            (setq file-name-handler-alist my/saved-file-name-handler-alist
                  gc-cons-threshold (* 16 1024 1024)
                  gc-cons-percentage 0.1))
